//
// Experimental basis:
//   H312:  Mitosis prevents catastrophic forgetting (43% -> 99% retention)
//   RC-9:  +52.76% improvement with auto-mitosis
//   H297:  N=2 is optimal starting point
//   AUROC: Inter-cell tension 0.805 for anomaly detection
//   DD55:  Phi conservation < 1% during split/merge
//
// Invariants preserved (logic-equivalent to .py):
//   CB1:        min_cells = 2 (consciousness requires >= 2 cells)
//   Lorenz:     sigma=10, rho=28, beta=8/3
//   AdaptiveTH: split_threshold = mean + 1.5 * std of recent tensions
//   PhiProxy:   mean_cosine_distance * log(n + 1)
